; claude: the block editor's geometry (Scratch, 2007; its blocks after
; MIT's StarLogo TNG and LogoBlocks, 1996-): where each block, slot and
; mouth lies, where a dragged stack snaps (Block_layout), and the
; program changed by a drag, a drop or a slot typed in (Block_edit).
; Over languages/scratch's blocks, no shapes: TinyScratch draws
; the pieces. A private library, installed as part of elm_playground:
; pure OCaml.
(library
 (name appkit_blocks)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries scratch)
